          <article class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon feature-icon-pink" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 18V9m5 9V5m5 13v-6m5 6V7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M2 21h20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
            <p class="feature-index">01 / ENCONTRAR</p>
            <h3>Analise a conversa</h3>
            <p>Transcreva a fala e avalie trechos por gancho, densidade de fala, energia do áudio e duração.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <span class="feature-icon feature-icon-blue" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="5" y="2.5" width="14" height="19" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="M9 6h6m-6 12h6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="m10 10 5 2-5 2v-4Z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>
